<title>USA: Royal Bancshares says ups div to $0.15.</title>
<headline>Royal Bancshares says ups div to $0.15.</headline>
<dateline>NARBERTH, Pa. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.15		     $0.12</p>
<p> Pay		     May 8</p>
<p> Record	     April 25</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Royal Bancshares of Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>The above dividend is for class A common stock. The company declared a cash dividend of $0.17 per share for holders of class B common stock. The company said it is a 25 percent increase over the cash dividend declared the last quarter.</p>
<p>The company also declared a four percent stock dividend on cclass A common stock and on class B common stock, to holders of record on April 28, and payable May 7.</p>
</text>
